Hi,

the BZR repositories of OpenPrinting are back online:

http://bzr.linuxfoundation.org/loggerhead/openprinting/

Both read and commit access are possible again. So now all contributors 
(especially printer manufacturers) can commit changes again.

Everyone with commit access is informed about how to proceed in a 
separate e-mail. If you had commit access before the Linux Foundation 
went off line and did not get a mail about commit access, please tell me.

    Till
